&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id="あらすじ"&gt;あらすじ&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;ldquo;Alright, that&amp;rsquo;s perfect.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Beautiful long fluttering hair, stylish-looking lips with thinly applied lipstick&amp;hellip;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The girl in the mirror was brimming with satisfied laughter.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Walking along the street attracted the attention of the guys - it was an extreme beauty. Unfortunately, though, what should&amp;rsquo;ve been a girl, was actually a boy.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The protagonist is a boy who loves women and hates men. That, coupled with his blunt manner of speaking, had been the cause of more than a few bad experiences in the past. (Experiences where they made fun of his androgynous looks and made him dress up as a girl.)&lt;/p&gt;</description></item><item><title>Anata, Gomennasai...</title><link>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/13918/</link><pubDate>Fri, 18 Apr 2014 00:00:00 +0800</pubDate><guid>https://yinghu.netlify.app/posts/13918/</guid><description>&lt;h2 id="ゲーム情報"&gt;ゲーム情報&lt;/h2&gt;
